<h1>Edgar Gonzalez, Jr.</h1>
<p>Illinois House, 23rd District, on the Chicago ballot November 3, 2026. Party: Democratic. Incumbent.</p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Has not published a platform for this race that we could find; he is unopposed. Bills he has sponsored, as listed on ilga.gov, cover technology regulation, gaming, workforce development, education, health care and consumer protection.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>Former in-district constituent services staffer for U.S. Rep. García and a Harvard graduate in government and economics; in the House since January 2020, where he is an Assistant Majority Leader.</p>
